  unitName: Impal
  unitId: 30573
  unitNumber: 939
  description: Creatures native to Ishgria which resemble tiny humans. As soon as
    a strong enemy steps into their territory, they call their comrades to form a
    strong resistance against incoming attacks. Though their battle power is often
    underestimated due to their small size, the Impal are astute creatures which
    can tell their opponents' weak points at a glance, subsequently emerging victorious
    from battle moments later. Curiously, the face carved on the staff the Impal
    leader wields in battle represents one of their deities, whom they offer thanks
    to once they have claimed victory on the battlefield.
  summonDesc: Gyogan gi gagagan gogo guga.<br>Goge gagi gagi goga giginga.<br>Gogo
    gogagyo gigage gige guge!
  fusionDesc: Gogo, gigaga gagagi gugu gu!<br>Gagogin gengogo gage gogo gega.<br>Gugogi
    ga gyogu gyogu gigegagu ga.
  evoDesc: Gogage gagi, gige gegega ga!<br>Gingen giguga gaggegi gagge...<br>Gugu,
    gugogi gogugu gogi gegige ga.
